Overlay patch 0007: ZAPD link options — iOS must take the Darwin branch
(-pthread only); the generic else adds -Wl,-export-dynamic (GNU ld), which
Apple's linker rejects ("ld: unknown options: -export-dynamic") and which
propagates PUBLIC into soh's final link.

--- a/ZAPDTR/ZAPD/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/ZAPDTR/ZAPD/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -375,7 +375,7 @@
 		-pthread
 	)
 
-    if (CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME STREQUAL "Darwin")
+    if (CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME MATCHES "Darwin|iOS")
         target_link_options(${PROJECT_NAME} PUBLIC
             -pthread
         )
